    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluffy Memories is a cozy tile-matching memory game featuring a variety of cute and kinky furry characters who'd love to show off for you when you win a match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own conversation and story to go along with their art pinups - and they're all eager to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 anthro characters, each with 4 unique pinups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulty settings\u00a0(keep it chill or challenge your memory!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal and challenge modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High scores and speed bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Range of queer diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable art gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 100% proudly human-drawn art by Aubrieta Rose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tile is a euphemism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe a secret hidden character..?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528950/extras/94c773bc978d223df8c46833362a32b7.avif?t=1750961289\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinnamon (she/her) - lop-eared cis bunny gal who loves cute lingerie and toys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jasper\u00a0(he/him) - trans male timber wolf who enjoys working out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pearl (she/her) - trans femme albino cobra with a praise kink and a love of leather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ivy (they/she) - nonbinary raccoon with witchy vibes and a brand new spellbook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ab